UML:
1. documents - The uploaded legal PDFs/documents
2. document_sections - Sliced articles/clauses from PDFs (deterministic anchoring)
3. regulations - Extracted regulatory provisions
4. rdtii_pillars - RDTII framework structure (pillars, criteria, indicators)
5. regulation_mappings - Mapping between extracted regulations and RDTII criteria
6. extracted_obligations - Specific compliance obligations extracted by LLM
7. audit_trail - Links JSON outputs to highlighted source text (for transparency UI)
8. countries - Country information (since they have data for 18 countries)
9. users (optional) - If there's user management

